uch like to ask Mr. Akuto to illustrate this BL couple: ......!\nPlease be assured that your request will be used for personal viewing only!\n\n▼ Please refer to the character's material here ^^\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/7e9TAcFXkQXFXz7v6\n\n☆The image of the finished product we expect\nIf you could draw in the style of (https://x.com/akuta_vi/status/1874110956315566236), I would be very happy! I would like to ask for two illustrations roughly like this, but of course you are free to adjust the canvas size, etc! ><\n\nAbout the character\nThe one with white hair → Cold, taciturn, serious and dependable in character. However, in front of the dark-haired one, a slightly childish side can be seen.\n(Be careful! →He has ahair and his pupils are cat's eyes)\n\nThe one with the black hair → He looks like he is dangling, but he has a solid side and is very outgoing. He always smiles like a cat.\n(Be careful! ) →He has fine aphtha hair, a tear bruise under his left eye, and a gray hair behind his left ear)\n\n-If possible, I would appreciate it if you could draw him with his hair like the last reference image!\n(The character with black hair is in braids, the one with white hair has her hair down.)\nIf the character's outfit is not to your liking, you may simply change it to a trench coat or other clothing!\nWe would appreciate it if you could finish the drawing in the way that is most comfortable for you.\n\nThank you very much for reading! If you are not satisfied with the price, please resubmit your request. (*^▽^*)\nHave a wonderful day! ✨", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@akuta_vi/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2126215, "client_id": 882075, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f109234cc77778b015cb7c9729c5395", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f109234cc77778b015cb7c9729c5395, https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12604fddb88f6cdcb008ce039785fa80 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3066d7ef1a6f712b0ce5e1ea6ab6f429 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9fe9961f5282a7971e679e5b383f9b46", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9fe9961f5282a7971e679e5b383f9b46, https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ff16c3d2f6c38d0f6e2ef2e523a5032 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0974f825e0ee8fd591be3eafa9dfbb97 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I'm a new member of the community and I'm looking for a new artwork! I love your artwork and would love to have some new clothes for my OC! I would like to request a new outfit for my OC.\nHe is a wizard who manipulates natural magic, has the power of the tides at his disposal, and also has the ability to steal other people's memories. On the outside, he exudes elegance and calm, but on the inside he is calm, intelligent, solitary and introverted. He is the lead actor in the theater \"The Sound of Tide\" and also runs it behind the scenes. To avenge his family's death, he uses his ability to secretly gather information and steal memories through the theater.\nIf you are short on budget, I am willing to send you additional money. Thank you in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MR_9ROWBFPn7-nWoJp3-MeIVv0RYCNud?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 897262, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "Nat.", "screen_name": "nat_latework", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1556307737482432512/Y361Bqyj.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1068005546408632320/1779427940/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 72, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 936728, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "らいすゅ", "screen_name": "ieki_doro_bou", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F27290093-cf74-49d8-8659-5afb23fdbd17.gif&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/webpublic-95c41c57-8864-4901-abd4-8b44b832f878.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_expiration_days": 95, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 2161422, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "イヌヤマダ", "screen_name": "hynehyo